---
import Content from '../layouts/Content.astro';
import FareTable from '../components/FareTable.astro';
import { destinations, fleet } from '../lib/fleet';

const site = 'https://adelaideairporttobarossa.com.au';
const slug = 'adelaide-airport-to-tanunda-transfer';
const url = `${site}/${slug}`;

const d = destinations.tanunda;
const nur = destinations.nuriootpa;
const [sedan, tarago, hiace] = fleet;

/* Township-specific questions only. The generic distance and duration questions are
   owned in schema by the logistics page, so three URLs do not compete for one query. */
const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'How long is the transfer from Adelaide Airport to Tanunda?',
    a: `About one hour door to door, roughly ${d.km} km north up the Sturt Highway through Gawler.`,
  },
  {
    q: 'How much is a transfer from Adelaide Airport to Tanunda?',
    a: `$${sedan.now} flat per car for up to ${sedan.seats} passengers, each way. $${tarago.now} for the seven-seat people mover and $${hiace.now} for the thirteen-seat bus.`,
  },
  {
    q: 'Will you drop me at my accommodation, or in the town centre?',
    a: 'At the address you give us. Cottages and rentals on side roads are normal here, so include the property name if there is one.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can you pick me up in Tanunda for a flight home?',
    a: 'Yes, at the same flat fare, timed back from your departure. Booking both legs together is one arrangement rather than two.',
  },
];

const schemas = [
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'Service',
    name: 'Adelaide Airport to Tanunda transfers',
    serviceType: 'Private airport transfer',
    description: `Private chauffeur transfer between Adelaide Airport and Tanunda, about ${d.km} km and ${d.min} minutes. Flat fare per vehicle, each way.`,
    provider: { '@id': `${site}/#business` },
    areaServed: { '@type': 'Place', name: 'Tanunda, South Australia' },
    url,
  },
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'FAQPage',
    mainEntity: faqs.map((f) => ({
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: f.q,
      acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: f.a },
    })),
  },
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
    itemListElement: [
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: `${site}/` },
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Adelaide Airport to Tanunda', item: url },
    ],
  },
];
---
<Content
  title="Adelaide Airport to Tanunda Transfer | $200 Flat, 1 Hour"
  description="Private transfer from Adelaide Airport to Tanunda. $200 flat per car, about 70 km and one hour, flight tracked and met in arrivals. Book both legs."
  slug={slug}
  h1="Adelaide Airport to Tanunda transfers"
  eyebrow="Tanunda &middot; the Barossa's visitor town"
  lead={`Tanunda is about ${d.km} km from Adelaide Airport, roughly one hour by road. A private transfer is $${sedan.now} flat per car for up to ${sedan.seats} passengers, each way, with the driver meeting you inside the arrivals hall.`}
  schemas={schemas}
>
  <p><strong>Tanunda is the Barossa township most visitors book</strong>, and the one most airport
  transfers run to. If your accommodation is on or near the main street, this is your page.</p>

  <h2>Why most people end up in Tanunda</h2>

  <p><strong>It is the valley's visitor town.</strong> More places to stay and more places to eat
  than anywhere else in the Barossa, which is why first-time visitors gravitate to it without quite
  knowing why.</p>

  <p><strong>It is also the practical choice</strong>, and this is the part nobody explains: Tanunda
  sits central enough that a day of cellar doors does not become a day of backtracking. From here
  the valley opens in both directions.</p>

  <p><strong>What that means for your transfer:</strong> you are almost certainly going to a street
  address rather than a resort gate. Give us the address on the booking, including the property name
  if it is a cottage or a rental, and that is where you are dropped. Not the main street, not
  "near enough".</p>

  <h2>The drive: about an hour, and the good part is at the end</h2>

  <p>Out of the airport, north around the city and up the <strong>Sturt Highway through
  Gawler</strong>. That stretch is ordinary and it is most of the trip.</p>

  <p><strong>Then the suburbs stop.</strong> Past Gawler the country opens, and the run in through
  Lyndoch and Rowland Flat is the one that tells you the holiday has started. Vine rows running away
  from the road on both sides, and about ten minutes later you are on Tanunda's main street.</p>

  <p><strong>About {d.km} km, about {d.min} minutes</strong>, door to door in normal traffic. Tanunda
  is the second-closest of the central townships, so it is a shorter run than Nuriootpa or
  Angaston.</p>

  <h2>What the ${sedan.now} covers</h2>

  <p><strong>One flat fare per car, each way.</strong> Not per person, not metered, and the same
  price whether you land at 6am or 11pm.</p>

  <FareTable caption="Flat fares per vehicle, each way, to the central Barossa townships." />

  <p><strong>Your flight is tracked by its number</strong>, so a late arrival moves the pick-up
  rather than costing you the booking. You are met inside the arrivals hall with a name sign, after
  baggage.</p>

  <p><strong>Book the return at the same time.</strong> The fare is identical in the other direction
  and it is one arrangement rather than two, which matters more than it sounds like on a Sunday
  morning with cases of wine.</p>

  <p><a class="btn" href="/#book">Get your Tanunda transfer &rarr;</a></p>

  <h2>Staying in Tanunda or Nuriootpa?</h2>

  <p><strong>A common question, and worth answering before you book anything.</strong> Tanunda is
  the visitor town: more to eat, more to walk to, more choice of where to sleep.
  <strong>Nuriootpa is the working town</strong>, with the supermarkets, the bakeries and the
  practical end of the valley, and the big-name cellar doors close by.</p>

  <p><strong>The transfer barely changes.</strong> Nuriootpa is {nur.km} km against Tanunda's
  {d.km}, about five minutes further, and the fare is the same ${sedan.now}. Choose on the town,
  not the trip.</p>

  <p><a href="/adelaide-airport-to-nuriootpa-transfer">Adelaide Airport to Nuriootpa transfers
  &rarr;</a></p>

  <h2>Tanunda transfer questions</h2>
  <div class="faq">
    {faqs.map((f) => (
      <>
        <h3>{f.q}</h3>
        <p>{f.a}</p>
      </>
    ))}
  </div>

  <p>More than four of you?
  <a href="/group-transfers-adelaide-airport-barossa-valley">Group transfers</a> &middot;
  Still deciding how to travel?
  <a href="/how-to-get-from-adelaide-airport-to-barossa-valley">Compare the options</a> &middot;
  <a href="/adelaide-airport-to-barossa-valley-distance-and-transfer-times">All distances and
  pickup detail</a></p>
</Content>
